@startuml cpu_timing_jitter_comparison
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title T-5: ジッタ分析 — 悪性ケース 詳細 (Phase 8 最大 2,713ms)\n良性 134ms との比較は legend 内に / 構造的天井 #1 顕在化メカニズム

robust "🚚 usb_thread send" as USB
robust "📡 gs2200m driver" as GS
concise "tx_buff[1]" as TX
concise "GS2200M 内部 buf" as INT
concise "WiFi ACK" as ACK

' ==============================================================
' 良性ケース 部分 (0-134ms): 圧縮表示で示す
' ==============================================================
@0
USB is "send start" #LightGreen
GS is "SPI loop" #LightYellow
TX is BUSY
INT is "余裕"
ACK is OK

@134
USB is "良性: send 完了" #LightGreen
GS is IDLE
TX is FREE
INT is "排出済"
ACK is OK
note bottom of USB
  良性ケース (Phase 8 平均) は 134ms で完了
  → 詳細は T-1 参照
end note

' ==============================================================
' 悪性ケース (134ms 以降に延長): 内部 buf 充填からスタック
' ==============================================================
@200
USB is "悪性: send (継続)" #Pink
GS is "SPI loop" #Pink
TX is BUSY
INT is "充填中" #LightYellow
ACK is "遅延"

@500
USB is "悪性: send (block)" #Pink
GS is "wait ACK" #Pink
TX is BUSY
INT is "ほぼ満杯" #Pink
ACK is "遅延"
note top of INT
  内部 buf 充填:
  直前のフレームの送信
  WiFi ACK 遅延が原因
end note

@1000
USB is "悪性: send (block)" #Pink
GS is "wait ACK" #Pink
TX is BUSY
INT is "満杯" #Pink
ACK is "タイムアウト"
note top of GS
  ACK タイムアウト発生
  WR_MAX_RETRY 100 まで再試行
end note

@1500
USB is "悪性: send (block)" #Pink
GS is "wait ACK" #Pink
TX is BUSY
INT is "満杯" #Pink

@2000
USB is "悪性: send (block)" #Pink
GS is "wait ACK" #Pink
TX is BUSY
INT is "満杯" #Pink

@2500
USB is "悪性: send (block)" #Pink
GS is "wait ACK" #Pink
TX is BUSY
INT is "排出開始" #LightYellow
ACK is "遅延"

@2700
USB is "悪性: send (継続)" #LightYellow
GS is "SPI loop 再開" #LightYellow
TX is BUSY
INT is "排出中" #LightYellow
ACK is OK

@2713
USB is "悪性: send 完了" #LightYellow
GS is IDLE
TX is FREE
INT is "排出済"
ACK is OK
note top of USB
  Phase 8 最大値 2,713ms に到達
  連続バースト負荷が引き金
end note

@2800
USB is IDLE
GS is IDLE

highlight 0 to 134 #LightGreen : "🟢 良性 134ms (平均)"
highlight 134 to 2713 #Pink : "🔴 悪性 2,713ms (最大, 平均の 20 倍)"

legend bottom
  **ジッタの正体 = 構造的天井 #1 が顕在化する条件**:

  • **平均 134ms** (Phase 8): GS2200M 内部 buf 排出が SPI 転送に追いつく
  • **最大 2,713ms** (Phase 8): 内部 buf が満杯 → ACK タイムアウト → WR_MAX_RETRY 100

  **顕在化トリガー**:
  1. 連続バースト負荷 (前フレーム未排出のうちに次フレーム送信)
  2. WiFi 環境劣化 (帯域競合, 電波弱化)
  3. ACK 遅延の累積

  **対比**:
  | 指標            | 良性   | 悪性    | 比 |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | TCP send 時間   | 134ms  | 2,713ms | 20× |
  | 影響 frame 数   | 1      | ~80     | 80× |
  | PC FPS への影響 | 微小   | 急落    | 重大 |

  **Phase 9 ピーク**: 5,228ms (Phase 8 比 1.9 倍悪化)
  Auto-Reconnect 戦略が品質を悪化させる原因の一つ → ADR-002 v1.1

  **解消手段**: Tier 2/3/C 移行 (構造的天井 #1 を経路自体から外す)

  関連: bak/04_test_results/22_PHASE8_PERFORMANCE_ANALYSIS.md
       bak/04_test_results/26_PHASE9_AUTO_RECONNECT_ANALYSIS.md
endlegend

@enduml
